/* DoL-MP v1.2.0-dev9: mp-region-moments-4.twee (36 passages: 20 Region Moment 8..10 + 16 Region Encounter 3..4) */

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>暴雨冲刷着断桅沉船滩的礁石，<<else>>退潮后的断桅沉船滩礁石间，<</if>>半截腐朽的船尾舵轮卡在石缝里，轮轴铜套内塞着一卷涂蜡帆布。铜套外侧扣着一圈带六角螺母的加固铜箍。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8 is 1>>
断桅沉船滩的船尾舵轮铜套今日已掏空，潮水正漫过石缝。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-8">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用撬棒别开舵轮铜套 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-8">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8")>><<money 300>>铜套应声松脱，涂蜡帆布里裹着几枚旧港银币与水路标图。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你在沉船舵轮里起获了旧港藏货。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着暗道往里查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	舵轮木刺扎了一下虎口，浪花拍湿了鞋面。<span class="red">你甩干手上的水珠退上高礁。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住气息重新发力 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回外围通道 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顺螺母旋下铜箍取出帆布 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-8">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8_alt")>><<money 360>>螺母顺滑旋出，你完整取出了未沾半点海水的涂蜡帆布包。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你凭精巧手法卸下了舵轮暗筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿着侧径继续深探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	螺母被海盐锈死，拧动时磨红了指节。<span class="red">你摸出小油壶准备先润透螺口。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[对准卡槽角度再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手退回外层 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜雾笼罩着雾角栈桥的系船柱，<<else>>海风掠过雾角栈桥末端的系船柱，<</if>>铁锚链环下压着一只被海浪冲上来的红铜信号哨匣。石阶角落正好散落着两块修船剩下的硬木楔。
<<if $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_8_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9 is 1>>
雾角栈桥锚链下的红铜信号哨匣今日已取走，铁链随浪轻晃。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-9">
<<swimicon>><<link "踩稳石阶抬起沉重锚链 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-9">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9")>><<money 300>>锚链挪开半寸，你顺利抽出了装着防水银票的红铜哨匣。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你凭臂力移开铁锚链取出了哨匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循着声响继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锚链滑腻沉重，手心一滑差点闪了腰。<span class="red">你扶住石柱先缓了一口气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦净指尖水汽再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起家伙退回主路 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用木楔垫入链环翘起锚链 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-9">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9_alt")>><<money 360>>木楔稳稳撑开链环，你毫不费力地勾出了底下的红铜哨匣。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">杠杆巧劲让你轻松拿到了哨匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着新辟的通路前行 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木楔在湿石上滑脱，溅起一串冷水花。<span class="red">你换了一块干硬橡木楔准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放缓手劲重新旋动 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回岔道口歇息 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
守塔人旧居阁楼的备用透镜箱锁扣松脱，箱底绒布下露出一角夹着津贴券的灯塔交接簿。绒布上方还压着一枚沉甸甸的备用椭圆形水晶透镜。
<<if $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_9_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3 is 1>>
守塔人旧居阁楼的备用透镜箱今日已整理妥当，箱盖严密合拢。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用细镊夹出绒布底交接簿 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3")>><<money 300>>交接簿完好抽出，内页夹着几张未兑付的航标津贴券。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你在透镜箱底寻获了守塔津贴。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[迈步转入下一段通道 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	透镜边缘锋利，擦过了你的手背。<span class="red">你包好手背退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准石缝受力点再试 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且退回安全地段 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "托起水晶透镜再掀底绒布 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3_alt")>><<money 360>>水晶透镜安稳移开，你将底衬下的交接簿与津贴悉数收好。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">稳妥手法护住了珍贵透镜与账册。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转过拐角继续查看 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	透镜沉重冰凉，托举时手腕一阵发酸。<span class="red">你先把透镜放回槽位歇手。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[借着微光看准再试 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收好随身工具离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
海蚀回音廊中段的石壁风孔在涨潮时发出低沉嗡鸣，气孔内侧卡着一只密封的鲸骨小筒。气孔边缘的石钉上挂着一圈用来疏通孔道的细铜丝。
<<if $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_3_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4 is 1>>
海蚀回音廊风孔内的鲸骨小筒今日已取出，风声清越通透。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-4">
<<sneakicon>><<link "趁退浪间隙探手勾出鲸骨筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-4">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4")>><<money 300>>你在下一波涌浪前精准勾出鲸骨筒，里面装着两枚古银币。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">回音廊的风声随之变得清亮悦耳。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[退出回廊返回入口 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	涌浪提前拍入风孔，冷海水灌湿了整条衣袖。<span class="red">你拧干衣袖退回干石台。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动手腕重新上手 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣角退回入口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用细铜丝套住鲸骨筒拉出 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4_alt")>><<money 360>>铜丝圈稳稳套住筒身，鲸骨小筒顺着石槽滑入你掌心。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你巧用铜丝套出了风孔藏筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿原路退出暗径 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	风孔气流湍急，吹偏了细铜丝的圈口。<span class="red">你把铜丝折成硬钩准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[理顺工具再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着石阶退回前段 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
守塔人石屋后墙的储水铜桶底座下垫着一块刻字的压舱铅块，铅块底部凹槽里藏着一枚防水铜币匣。储水铜桶下方的黄铜放水龙头还能顺畅拧动。
<<if $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_foghorn_4_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10 is 1>>
守塔人石屋储水铜桶下的压舱铅块今日已放稳，滴水声平缓规律。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-10">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用铁钎撬起储水桶边角取匣 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-10">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10")>><<money 320>>储水桶微微倾斜，你迅速抽出压舱铅块下的防水铜币匣。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你撬起储水桶底座拿到了铜币匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转往深处查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜桶盛满雨水颇为沉重，铁钎滑了一下。<span class="red">你调整铁钎支点准备再试。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准支点重新尝试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着来路先行撤回 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拧龙头放掉半桶水搬铅块 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-10">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_foghorn_10_alt")>><<money 380>>水位下降后铜桶轻了大半，你毫不费力地取出了铅块下的铜币匣。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">放水减重后你稳妥取出了铜币匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着走廊往里走 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	龙头铜栓有些生涩，冷水溅湿了手腕。<span class="red">你擦干手腕准备再用力拧栓。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
