:: MP Region Moment Glasshouse 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
雾化兰花厅的恒温喷头支架后挂着一只小巧的黄铜授粉刷盒，盒扣上缠着半圈银丝花藤。支架旁挂着一只装满温水的喷壶，用来软化缠紧的干藤。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_glasshouse_8 is 1>>
雾化兰花厅支架后的授粉刷盒今日已收妥，兰花在水雾中舒展。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-8">
<<tendingicon>><<link "轻拨银丝花藤取下黄铜刷盒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-8">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_glasshouse_8 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_glasshouse_8")>><<money 300>>花藤无损解开，刷盒夹层里装着育种奖金与一枚兰花银徽。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你轻巧解下花藤取出了刷盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿着石壁往前探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	花藤叶缘带刺，轻轻划了你的手腕一下。<span class="red">你吹了吹手腕浅痕退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动手腕重新上手 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣角退回入口 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "喷温水软化藤蔓顺向解扣 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-8">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_glasshouse_8 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_glasshouse_8_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_glasshouse_8_alt")>><<money 360>>湿润的银丝花藤柔顺舒展，你毫不费力地取下了黄铜刷盒。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你用温水润泽花藤拿到了刷盒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循着微光往里走 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	喷水壶嘴偏了半寸，水雾喷湿了你的额发。<span class="red">你擦干额发调正喷嘴准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[理顺工具再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着石阶退回前段 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

