<<getouticon>><<link [[返回黑铁货运 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_blackiron_8 is 1>>
八号道岔枕木夹缝里的防水油布夹今日已取走，铁轨静卧荒草间。
<<else>>
