<<else>>
	生锈垫片卡在枕木里，震得你虎口发酸。<span class="red">你甩了甩手腕退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准石缝受力点再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且退回安全地段 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
