:: MP Region Moment Druid 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
月泉祭坛畔的古橡树根洞里塞着一只蜂蜡封口的陶罐，树根上停着两只机警的灰林鸮。祭坛石沿上散落着几粒饱满的干松子，树根背侧留有一道窄缝。
<<if $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_druid_8_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回古德鲁伊 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_druid_9 is 1>>
月泉祭坛古橡树根洞里的蜂蜡陶罐今日已开启过，林鸮安静栖息。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-druid-9">
<<tendingicon>><<link "撒出几粒松子引开灰林鸮 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-druid-9">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_druid_9 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_druid_9")>><<money 300>>灰林鸮低头啄食松子，你顺利抱出陶罐，收好里面的古币与草药。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">灰林鸮啄食松子后退开，你抱出了树洞陶罐。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循着声响继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	灰林鸮振翅低鸣一声，惊得你手背擦在树皮上。<span class="red">你退后两步等林鸮安静下来。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦净指尖水汽再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起家伙退回主路 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "从树根背侧空隙抽出陶罐 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-druid-9">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_moment_druid_9 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_druid_9_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_moment_druid_9_alt")>><<money 360>>你未惊动枝头林鸮分毫，悄无声息地将蜂蜡陶罐抽入怀中。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你借树根盲区无声取走了陶罐。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着新辟的通路前行 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	脚下枯枝咔嚓轻响，林鸮警觉地歪头盯住你。<span class="red">你屏息不动暂且退回泉边。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放缓手劲重新旋动 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回岔道口歇息 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Druid 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
古根地穴的萤石壁龛下压着一卷用藤皮包裹的采药手记，边角露出一枚猎人公会银章。手记外圈缠着干枯藤蔓打成的死结，旁边石台上放着一柄采药骨刀。
<<if $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_druid_9_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回古德鲁伊 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_druid_3 is 1>>
古根地穴萤石壁龛下的藤皮手记今日已翻检完毕，萤石微光柔和。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-druid-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨开盘结须根抽出藤皮手记 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-druid-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_druid_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_druid_3")>><<money 300>>须根柔韧分开，你将猎人银章与手记里的林间赏金收入袋中。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你在古根壁龛下寻获了采药手记。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[迈步转入下一段通道 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	潮湿树根滑脱回弹，打在你的手腕上。<span class="red">你揉了揉手腕准备用木棍撑开须根。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准石缝受力点再试 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且退回安全地段 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用骨刀挑开石龛枯藤死结 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-druid-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_druid_3 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_druid_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_druid_3_alt")>><<money 360>>枯藤死结一挑即开，藤皮手记与银章完好落入你掌中。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你挑开枯藤顺遂取出了手记与银章。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转过拐角继续查看 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	地穴光线幽暗，骨刀刃背磕在石壁上。<span class="red">你举近萤石看清藤结准备再挑。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[借着微光看准再试 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收好随身工具离开 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Druid 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
守林人瞭望台顶层的风向木牌后藏着一只防潮锡筒，里面封着巡山猎人留下的应急路费。风向木牌底座设有一枚可放低桅杆的木制活动插销。
<<if $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_druid_3_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
