	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[退出回廊返回入口 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	林梢阵风猛烈，吹得木栏晃动，你忙缩回手。<span class="red">你扶稳瞭望台立柱先缓了口气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动手腕重新上手 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣角退回入口 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "转动底座插销将锡筒放低 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-druid-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_druid_4 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_druid_4_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_druid_4_alt")>><<money 360>>风向标顺着合页缓缓放平，你站在台内便轻松取下了锡筒。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你巧转底座插销安全取下了锡筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿原路退出暗径 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	底座插销沾满松脂，转动时粘住了手指。<span class="red">你用小刀刮去松脂准备再转。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[理顺工具再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着石阶退回前段 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
