:: MP Region Encounter Velvet 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
露台观海雅座的丝绒靠垫夹缝里卡着一只金丝零钱包，搭扣上嵌着一枚红宝石胸针。雅座外侧垂着厚重的防风纱幔，海风吹拂时恰好遮住视线。
<<if $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_moment_velvet_9_alt"]>><span class="teal">凭借先前在上一处留下的巧手布置，你眼下的动作愈发得心应手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁天鹅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_velvet_3 is 1>>
露台观海雅座的丝绒靠垫今日已整理平整，海风吹拂着轻纱帷幔。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-velvet-3">
<<sneakicon>><<link "坐雅座摸金丝零钱包 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-velvet-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_velvet_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_velvet_3")>><<money 300>>你借着落座的动作将零钱包与里面的金券自然收入怀中。<<else>>你熟练地复现了先前的步骤，里头的钱物虽已取走，仔细核验一遍仍让你心里踏实不少。<</if>><span class="green">你从容不迫地取走了靠垫夹缝里的钱包。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着暗道往里查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Velvet 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	胸针别针未扣严，轻轻扎了一下你的指尖。<span class="red">你按住指尖假装看海缓了缓。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住气息重新发力 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Velvet 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回外围通道 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "借海风吹起纱幔解开搭扣 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-velvet-3">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_velvet_3 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpReg4_mp_region_encounter_velvet_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg4_rew_mp_region_encounter_velvet_3_alt")>><<money 360>>白纱翻飞间你已解下胸针与零钱包，不留半点翻动痕迹。<<else>>你轻车熟路地完成了整套手法，虽未再翻出额外的钱袋，却把现场理得井井有条。<</if>><<control 1>><span class="green">你借轻纱掩护巧手取下了零钱包。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿着侧径继续深探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Velvet 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风吹乱了你的发丝，挡住了手上的视线。<span class="red">你拢好耳畔发丝准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[对准卡槽角度再试 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Velvet 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手退回外层 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Velvet 4 [nobr]
