<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顺着纱帘暗袋将镜盒解下 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-velvet-4">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250>>
